THE CONTROLS, READ FIRST
============================================================================================
  Contiguity 1.00. Stored runs are real trajectories now.

  scramble is the known-bad arm. August measured scrambled replay damaging
  shared knowledge, 96.2% against 99.8%.

  shared:     veridical 99.9%   scramble 100.0%   (+0.0)
